{"id":"82a3b4cc2d3373ec","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-gelfand-representations.md","title":"Gelfand Representation","display":"df-gelfand-representations — Gelfand Representation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-gelfand-representations","aliases":["58-df-gelfand-representations","Gelfand Representation"],"display":"df-gelfand-representations — Gelfand Representation","depends_on":["[[58-df-banach-algebra]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-gelfand-representations"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-gelfand-representations</span><span>Gelfand Representation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gelfand-representations — Gelfand Representation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"630c319f5a2106ce\" href=\"?note=630c319f5a2106ce\" title=\"58-df-banach-algebra\">58-df-banach-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A,\\Delta,\\Gamma\\in V\">\\(A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A,\\Delta,\\Gamma\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BanachAlgStructure}_S(A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A)\">\\(\\mathrm{BanachAlgStructure}_S(A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"630c319f5a2106ce\" href=\"?note=630c319f5a2106ce\" title=\"58-df-banach-algebra\">58-df-banach-algebra</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(\\phi,A,\\mathbb C)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(\\phi,A,\\mathbb C)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CommutativeUnitalBanachAlgebra}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{CommutativeUnitalBanachAlgebra}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Character}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{Character}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GelfandSpectrum}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{GelfandSpectrum}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GelfandRepresentation}_S\\subseteq V^8\">\\(\\mathrm{GelfandRepresentation}_S\\subseteq V^8\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}commutative\\text{-}unital\\text{-}banach\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{CommutativeUnitalBanachAlgebra}_S(A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{BanachAlgStructure}_S(A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A)\\land1_A\\in A\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in A\\;(a\\cdot_A b=b\\cdot_A a)\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(1_A\\cdot_A a=a=a\\cdot_A1_A).\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}commutative\\text{-}unital\\text{-}banach\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{CommutativeUnitalBanachAlgebra}_S(A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{BanachAlgStructure}_S(A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A)\\land1_A\\in A\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in A\\;(a\\cdot_A b=b\\cdot_A a)\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(1_A\\cdot_A a=a=a\\cdot_A1_A).\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gelfand\\text{-}character}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{Character}_S(\\phi,A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Function}(\\phi,A,\\mathbb C)\\land\\phi(1_A)=1\\land\\forall a,b\\in A\\;(\\phi(a+_A b)=\\phi(a)+\\phi(b)\\land\\phi(a\\cdot_A b)=\\phi(a)\\phi(b))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\phi(\\lambda\\odot_A a)=\\lambda\\phi(a))\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall a\\in A\\;(|\\phi(a)|\\leq C\\|a\\|_A).\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gelfand\\text{-}character}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{Character}_S(\\phi,A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Function}(\\phi,A,\\mathbb C)\\land\\phi(1_A)=1\\land\\forall a,b\\in A\\;(\\phi(a+_A b)=\\phi(a)+\\phi(b)\\land\\phi(a\\cdot_A b)=\\phi(a)\\phi(b))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\phi(\\lambda\\odot_A a)=\\lambda\\phi(a))\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall a\\in A\\;(|\\phi(a)|\\leq C\\|a\\|_A).\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gelfand\\text{-}spectrum}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{GelfandSpectrum}_S(\\Delta,A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{CommutativeUnitalBanachAlgebra}_S(A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Delta=\\{\\phi\\in{}^A\\mathbb C:\\mathrm{Character}_S(\\phi,A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\}.\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gelfand\\text{-}spectrum}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{GelfandSpectrum}_S(\\Delta,A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{CommutativeUnitalBanachAlgebra}_S(A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Delta=\\{\\phi\\in{}^A\\mathbb C:\\mathrm{Character}_S(\\phi,A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\}.\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gelfand\\text{-}representations}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{GelfandRepresentation}_S(\\Gamma,\\Delta,A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{GelfandSpectrum}_S(\\Delta,A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\Gamma,A,{}^\\Delta\\mathbb C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;\\forall\\phi\\in\\Delta\\;(\\Gamma(a)(\\phi)=\\phi(a)).\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gelfand\\text{-}representations}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{GelfandRepresentation}_S(\\Gamma,\\Delta,A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{GelfandSpectrum}_S(\\Delta,A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\Gamma,A,{}^\\Delta\\mathbb C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;\\forall\\phi\\in\\Delta\\;(\\Gamma(a)(\\phi)=\\phi(a)).\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The graph exposes all algebra operations and defines characters as bounded unital multiplicative complex-linear functionals.</li>\n<li>The Gelfand transform first lands in the full function set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"({}^\\Delta\\mathbb C)\">\\(({}^\\Delta\\mathbb C)\\)</span>; continuity requires the weak-star topology on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\">\\(\\Delta\\)</span> and is a downstream theorem rather than an undefined <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C(\\Delta(A))\">\\(C(\\Delta(A))\\)</span> primitive.</li>\n<li>With the weak-star topology, the spectrum is compact Hausdorff.</li>\n<li>Wiener algebra <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A(\\mathbb{T})\">\\(A(\\mathbb{T})\\)</span>: absolutely convergent Fourier series; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta(A) = \\mathbb{T}\">\\(\\Delta(A) = \\mathbb{T}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rudin, Functional Analysis</li>\n<li>Gelfand, Raikov and Shilov, Commutative Normed Rings</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-banach-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"630c319f5a2106ce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-banach-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-banach-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"630c319f5a2106ce","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BanachAlgStructure}_S(A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A)$ (see [[58-df-banach-algebra]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}(\\phi,A,\\mathbb C)$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A,\\Delta,\\Gamma\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BanachAlgStructure}_S(A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(\\phi,A,\\mathbb C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CommutativeUnitalBanachAlgebra}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Character}_S\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GelfandSpectrum}_S\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GelfandRepresentation}_S\\subseteq V^8","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}commutative\\text{-}unital\\text{-}banach\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash{}&\\mathrm{CommutativeUnitalBanachAlgebra}_S(A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{BanachAlgStructure}_S(A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A)\\land1_A\\in A\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a,b\\in A\\;(a\\cdot_A b=b\\cdot_A a)\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(1_A\\cdot_A a=a=a\\cdot_A1_A).\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gelfand\\text{-}character}\\vdash{}&\\mathrm{Character}_S(\\phi,A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{Function}(\\phi,A,\\mathbb C)\\land\\phi(1_A)=1\\land\\forall a,b\\in A\\;(\\phi(a+_A b)=\\phi(a)+\\phi(b)\\land\\phi(a\\cdot_A b)=\\phi(a)\\phi(b))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\phi(\\lambda\\odot_A a)=\\lambda\\phi(a))\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall a\\in A\\;(|\\phi(a)|\\leq C\\|a\\|_A).\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gelfand\\text{-}spectrum}\\vdash{}&\\mathrm{GelfandSpectrum}_S(\\Delta,A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{CommutativeUnitalBanachAlgebra}_S(A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\\\\n&\\land\\Delta=\\{\\phi\\in{}^A\\mathbb C:\\mathrm{Character}_S(\\phi,A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\}.\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gelfand\\text{-}representations}\\vdash{}&\\mathrm{GelfandRepresentation}_S(\\Gamma,\\Delta,A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{GelfandSpectrum}_S(\\Delta,A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\Gamma,A,{}^\\Delta\\mathbb C)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;\\forall\\phi\\in\\Delta\\;(\\Gamma(a)(\\phi)=\\phi(a)).\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"({}^\\Delta\\mathbb C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"C(\\Delta(A))","display":false},{"tex":"A(\\mathbb{T})","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta(A) = \\mathbb{T}","display":false}],"bytes":3115,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-578","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-gelfand-representations.md|58-df-gelfand-representations]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["630c319f5a2106ce","36d7463d215be751"]}